{"sourceUrl":"https://sfs.ustb.edu.cn/cn/xinwenzhongxin/zhaoshengxinxi1/2025-09-17/6889.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:16.409213+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sfs.ustb.edu.cn/cn/xinwenzhongxin/zhaoshengxinxi1/2025-09-17/6889.html","html":"<div>\n<p> <span>2026</span><span>年推免生预报名启动第二批次报名工作，相关事宜通知如下：</span></p>\n<p><span>一、申请说明<span></span></span></p>\n<p><span>本次第二批次预报名仅限翻译硕士专业（<span>055100</span>），包括英语笔译、英语口译、翻译（日语）和翻译（德语）四个方向。<span></span></span></p>\n<p><span>申请条件、选拔程序、报名填写、材料要求、资格审核、面试考核要求，按照《外国语学院<span>2026</span>年推免生预报名活动公告》中相关规定执行。<span></span></span></p>\n<p><span>二、报名时间<span></span></span></p>\n<p><span>2025</span><span>年<span>9</span>月<span>17</span>日<span>12:00-9</span>月<span>18</span>日<span>12:00</span>之间登录我校推免预报名系统（<span>http://yjsy.ustb.edu.cn/ksxt/logon</span>）报名并提交相关材料。<span></span></span></p>\n<p><span>第一次已报名因时间未参加面试的考生，可使用本人身份证号和手机号重新注册新的报名号，再次报名，此前报名的志愿无效。面试预计安排在<span>9</span>月<span>19</span>日，具体面试安排待通知。<span></span></span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span>咨询电话：<span>010-62332456</span>（樊老师）<span></span></span></p>\n<p><span>学院官网：<span>http://sfs.ustb.edu.cn/cn/index.html</span></span></p> </div>","textSha256":"b525490dab1a089a0399c133e1ef7cae5f2e81ea904282ad9885d2929fc929b1","textLength":390,"sourceSha256":"7f821402e505c3f83fb58bc0286e4f10f8c4b6f760822ee6270b7b76f70b5f3f","selector":"article-like:second_page_content_text","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-40ddb87d492ce0cd5948","title":"2025年北京科技大学外国语学院2026年启动第二批次推免生预报名活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:16.409213+00:00"}
